### A17 (pp. 255–265).

298
01:08:57,214 --> 01:09:02,102
Recurrence Quantification Analysis of Gaze Dynamics During Team Collaboration

299
01:09:02,102 --> 01:09:10,727
*Angelina Abitino, Robert G. Moulder, Brandon M. Booth, Sidney K. D'Mello (University of Colorado Boulder).

300
01:09:10,727 --> 01:09:13,702
LAK23, Arlington.

